---
title: "obligation::try_borrow_asset (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_existing: debts.contains(CoinType)?
    q_check_existing --> q_new_borrow: no existing debt
    q_check_existing --> q_existing_borrow: has existing debt
    q_new_borrow --> q_check_col_conflict: CoinType used as collateral?
    q_check_col_conflict --> q_error_col: is_supporting_collateral == true
    q_check_col_conflict --> q_init_debt: is_supporting_collateral == false
    q_error_col --> [*]: abort obligation_borrow_collateral_asset
    q_init_debt --> [*]: debts.add(CoinType, Debt(amount, borrow_index))
    q_existing_borrow --> q_accrue: obligation.accrue_interest(CoinType, borrow_index)
    q_accrue --> q_increase: debt.unsafe_increase(amount)
    q_increase --> [*]: return debt.unsafe_debt_amount()

    note right of q_check_col_conflict
        INV-001: Cannot borrow asset that is deposited as collateral (same obligation)
        INV-002: Cannot deposit asset that is borrowed (same obligation)
        INV-003: First borrow initializes debt with current borrow_index
        INV-004: Subsequent borrows accrue interest before increasing debt
    end note
